      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000011",
      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 21,
      "end_line": 31,
      "raw": "```cpp\n#include <iiHtmlBlock>\n\niiHtmlBlock::DivideBlock divider;\n\nif (divider.Parse(\"<XML><section><span>text</span></section></XML>\")) {\n    // divider.GetElements()[1].tag_name == \"section\"\n    // divider.GetElements()[1].is_block == true\n    // divider.GetBlockElements().size() == 1\n}\n```\n",
      "language": "cpp",
      "code": "#include <iiHtmlBlock>\n\niiHtmlBlock::DivideBlock divider;\n\nif (divider.Parse(\"<XML><section><span>text</span></section></XML>\")) {\n    // divider.GetElements()[1].tag_name == \"section\"\n    // divider.GetElements()[1].is_block == true\n    // divider.GetBlockElements().size() == 1\n}\n",
      "closed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b000012",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 32,
      "end_line": 32,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 33,
      "end_line": 34,
      "raw": "이미 `GetTagInfo::RangeInfo`를 가지고 있다면 전체 입력을 다시 저장하지 않고\n`iiHtmlBlock::DivideBlock::IsBlockElement(range)`로 같은 규칙을 적용할 수 있다.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000014",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 35,
      "end_line": 35,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
